5,0,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm Rin. This looks like a fun adventure!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,Greetings. I am George. Let us proceed with caution and wisdom.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,H-hello... I'm Daisuke. I hope we can all get along well.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello, dear children. I am Shizue. Let us find peace together.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hi everyone! I'm Midori. I'm looking forward to a peaceful day.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,I wonder who is the werewolf? It's so mysterious!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"We must observe carefully. Trust is key, but so is vigilance.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't know what to do. I just want to help.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Take your time, Daisuke. We are all here to support each other.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"That's very kind of you, Shizue. I agree, we should be gentle.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,I feel like George is being very serious. Is he hiding something?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,I am simply being prudent. My age demands a certain gravity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm sorry... I didn't mean to cause trouble. I'm just nervous.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"No trouble at all, Daisuke. Your honesty is a virtue.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I think Daisuke is being very brave to speak up. I support him.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! Let's just wait for night to see what happens.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,George,,Agreed. Rest well. The truth will reveal itself in time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
